# Mechanical: what a machine writes for any contract. Complete and visible, and not pleasant.

SCREEN Home ABOUT Alice:
    QUESTIONS
    SHOW Alice: identity, person
    LIST People: EVERYONE WITH knows, friend, at, won, drawn OPENS Person
    LIST Started: "Alice has started Game"
    LIST Color: "Alice has the color Side in Game"
    LIST Made: "Alice has made Move in Game at Board"
    Establish: Alice may establish an identity
    Acquaint: Alice and Bob may jointly come to know each other, Bob TYPED
    Introduce: Alice may introduce Carol to Bob, Bob FROM knows, Carol FROM knows
    Befriend: Alice and Bob may jointly become friends, Bob FROM knows
    Unfriend: Alice may end her friendship with Bob, Bob FROM friend
    Start: Alice and Bob may jointly start Game at Board, Bob FROM friend, Game TYPED
    Move: Alice may make Move in Game against Bob from Board to Next, Bob FROM at, Game FROM at, Board FROM at, Move TYPED
    Win: Alice may claim Game against Bob at Board, Bob FROM at, Game FROM at, Board FROM at
    Resign: Alice may resign Game against Bob at Board, Bob FROM at, Game FROM at, Board FROM at
    Draw: Alice and Bob may jointly draw Game at Board, Bob FROM at, Game FROM at, Board FROM at

SCREEN Person ABOUT Bob:
    QUESTIONS
    SHOW Bob: knows, friend, at, won, drawn
